  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-spatial-regression.\n\n- Provides an end-to-end spatial regression workflow: OLS fitting, residual spatial autocorrelation diagnostics, and spatial lag/error model estimation.\n- Supports OLS and residual Moran\u2019s I diagnostics as well as LM-lag and LM-error tests.\n- Implements maximum likelihood estimation for both SLM and SEM, including grid search and exact log-determinant calculation.\n- Works fully offline, supporting both synthetic (simulated) data and local input files.\n- Outputs primary regression results and run manifests in standard formats (GeoTIFF/GeoJSON/JSON).",
